1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,760
Don't wanna date an engineering student?

2
00:00:01,950 --> 00:00:02,750
No.

3
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:05,590
Then how about a soccer player?

4
00:00:05,870 --> 00:00:07,970
Are you really serious about him?

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:08,800
Yeah.

6
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:13,070
Master still wants to talk to you, Mr. Jin.

7
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:15,340
But your dad probably needs you.

8
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:16,640
Does he want me

9
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:19,020
or someone to take over his business?

10
00:00:19,030 --> 00:00:20,320
I'm going to the police station.

11
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:22,590
I'm gonna talk to the police
about the laptop, the phone, and...

12
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:23,580
these earbuds.

13
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:25,560
Don't give them to the police.

14
00:00:26,290 --> 00:00:27,350
Anda told me...

15
00:00:27,370 --> 00:00:28,340
not to give them to the police.

16
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:30,960
Could it be that someone made him take the pill?

17
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:33,310
Or drugged him.

18
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:34,300
You know,

19
00:00:34,330 --> 00:00:36,400
Anda was always targeted by haters.

20
00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:38,910
There was this one account
that'd been stirring up all the hate.

21
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:40,540
"Emma."

22
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:43,230
"AMME..."

23
00:00:45,330 --> 00:00:47,570
An account called "Andaman TH"

24
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:50,590
has revealed
the identity of Anda's hater.

25
00:00:53,550 --> 00:00:55,030
I've figured out who killed Anda.

26
00:00:55,420 --> 00:00:57,030
If Anda was really murdered,

27
00:00:57,050 --> 00:00:57,970
then I...

28
00:00:58,860 --> 00:01:00,280
will bring the killer to justice myself.

29
00:01:04,489 --> 00:01:06,270
[Engineering Love Struck]

30
00:01:23,110 --> 00:01:24,300
Is there really no one here?

31
00:01:30,039 --> 00:01:31,460
I mean, if you really want to know,

32
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:32,970
why don't you just knock on the door?

33
00:01:36,110 --> 00:01:37,490
Amp probably ran far away by now.

34
00:01:38,539 --> 00:01:39,780
That's creepy.

35
00:01:39,800 --> 00:01:41,690
A murderer is living
right next door to you.

36
00:01:43,330 --> 00:01:44,340
I think...

37
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,370
Think...

38
00:01:47,070 --> 00:01:48,729
Don't leave me hanging. Tell me.

39
00:01:49,190 --> 00:01:51,000
Why do I feel like
I don't suspect Amp at all?

40
00:01:51,660 --> 00:01:52,310
Hey.

41
00:01:52,759 --> 00:01:53,860
Get a grip, Podduang.

42
00:01:54,530 --> 00:01:56,190
A hater is a hater.

43
00:01:56,750 --> 00:01:59,420
We never know what people
we share the elevator with

44
00:01:59,450 --> 00:02:00,680
are actually like.

45
00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:04,080
True, I saw it with my own eyes.

46
00:02:04,110 --> 00:02:06,860
Her hater-hunting skills are brutal.

47
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:09,900
How about you next, Dunk?

48
00:02:09,930 --> 00:02:13,600
Jeez, when we're alone,
you use all those sweet terms.

49
00:02:15,210 --> 00:02:16,140
Smartass.

50
00:02:18,720 --> 00:02:19,320
But...

51
00:02:20,060 --> 00:02:21,800
Amp looks perfectly normal.

52
00:02:22,610 --> 00:02:23,840
Every time I see her,

53
00:02:23,870 --> 00:02:25,720
it feels like she's the one in danger.

54
00:02:26,740 --> 00:02:29,300
Hey, don't play the good guy now.

55
00:02:29,970 --> 00:02:31,570
But I'm being serious.

56
00:02:31,750 --> 00:02:33,160
It seems like she has her own problems.

57
00:02:33,540 --> 00:02:35,290
Well, that's because she did something wrong.

58
00:02:35,310 --> 00:02:38,170
We only have information, not evidence.

59
00:02:38,530 --> 00:02:40,750
Isn't it a bit harsh

60
00:02:40,780 --> 00:02:42,180
to accuse her of being a murderer?

61
00:02:44,650 --> 00:02:47,200
I know you two love Anda

62
00:02:47,230 --> 00:02:48,660
and are very upset about this.

63
00:02:49,130 --> 00:02:51,829
But I think we need to stay calm.

64
00:02:53,230 --> 00:02:54,650
Anyway, Podduang.

65
00:02:55,170 --> 00:02:56,770
That Amp next door

66
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:58,640
knows you're an Anda fan.

67
00:02:59,160 --> 00:03:00,670
She is dangerous to you anyway.

68
00:03:01,500 --> 00:03:02,410
I think...

69
00:03:02,980 --> 00:03:04,490
you shouldn't be here for now.

70
00:03:05,440 --> 00:03:08,280
I agree. Better safe than sorry.

71
00:03:09,270 --> 00:03:10,330
And if I'm not here,

72
00:03:11,010 --> 00:03:12,510
what about Satang?

73
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:15,250
Are you really his brother?

74
00:03:15,530 --> 00:03:17,810
The freshman soccer players
are at a training camp in Khao Yai.

75
00:03:18,270 --> 00:03:20,730
Oh, I didn't know about that.

76
00:03:25,940 --> 00:03:27,220
It reminds me of the time
the three of us lived together.

77
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,560
Just like back in freshman year.

78
00:03:29,180 --> 00:03:30,610
Okay, I'll go then.

79
00:03:30,790 --> 00:03:32,290
- Hey! Wait, wait, wait.
- Hold on.

80
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,530
I wasn't going to have you stay with me.

81
00:03:35,570 --> 00:03:36,370
What?

82
00:03:38,510 --> 00:03:39,650
Then what about me?

83
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:56,190
[The depicted characters, behaviors, locations,
organizations, professions, and events]

84
00:03:56,210 --> 00:03:57,710
[are fictional and created
for entertainment purposes only.]

85
00:03:57,740 --> 00:04:00,000
[It is not intended to endorse or promote
any of the actions or behavior depicted.]

86
00:04:00,030 --> 00:04:01,120
[Viewer discretion is advised.]

87
00:04:13,870 --> 00:04:20,120
♫I used to wonder what we were,♫

88
00:04:20,339 --> 00:04:26,220
♫I thought love needed something clearer,♫

89
00:04:26,940 --> 00:04:32,240
♫Took me time to learn what really matters♫

90
00:04:33,850 --> 00:04:38,930
♫Love has no rules, whatever comes after♫

91
00:04:40,310 --> 00:04:45,680
♫As long as I know what my heart wants to find,♫

92
00:04:46,110 --> 00:04:48,720
♫As long as you're standing by my side,♫

93
00:04:48,740 --> 00:04:51,970
♫With you, the only one I'd choose every time,♫

94
00:04:51,990 --> 00:04:55,750
♫I don't need a reason, as long as you're mine♫

95
00:04:56,390 --> 00:04:59,159
♫As long as you hold my hand,♫

96
00:04:59,490 --> 00:05:01,890
♫As long as next to me is where you stand,♫

97
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:05,340
♫You're the one I'll always try to understand,♫

98
00:05:05,370 --> 00:05:09,100
♫No matter how hard the road may be,♫

99
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:12,290
♫Just hold my hand, and we'll be free♫

100
00:05:13,010 --> 00:05:15,820
♫As long as you're here with me♫

101
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:22,280
Need help carrying anything?

102
00:05:22,300 --> 00:05:24,590
Uh...

103
00:05:25,020 --> 00:05:25,820
What's up?

104
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,120
It's just that...

105
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:31,050
What is it?

106
00:05:31,260 --> 00:05:32,860
You're acting like you've never
slept with me before.

107
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,740
What's with you, Jin?

108
00:05:35,430 --> 00:05:36,990
I'm not going.

109
00:05:39,450 --> 00:05:40,090
Okay.

110
00:05:52,830 --> 00:05:53,980
Wait a minute.

111
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:55,080
Since you're not going,

112
00:05:55,430 --> 00:05:57,630
I'm sleeping here instead.

113
00:05:57,650 --> 00:05:59,510
Why are you doing this?

114
00:06:03,470 --> 00:06:04,690
I'm just worried about you.

115
00:06:06,690 --> 00:06:09,320
It's not just me, you know.

116
00:06:10,280 --> 00:06:12,050
Your friends are worried, too.

117
00:06:12,250 --> 00:06:14,130
Everyone is worried about you.

118
00:06:15,690 --> 00:06:17,710
Okay, thanks.

119
00:06:19,510 --> 00:06:20,980
So do you want me to help you pack?

120
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:24,440
No, it's fine. Just wait here.

121
00:06:43,670 --> 00:06:45,909
You were quite cute as a kid.

122
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:51,880
What are you doing in here?

123
00:06:51,900 --> 00:06:53,470
Who let you in?

124
00:06:53,490 --> 00:06:54,080
Well,

125
00:06:54,690 --> 00:06:55,920
the door was open.

126
00:07:01,200 --> 00:07:02,040
[The Field of Love]

127
00:07:02,060 --> 00:07:02,810
[Dorm Mate]

128
00:07:02,830 --> 00:07:03,890
This corner is nice.

129
00:07:04,640 --> 00:07:06,630
Anda would be so happy to see

130
00:07:07,390 --> 00:07:08,710
that he had a fan like you.

131
00:07:08,730 --> 00:07:09,740
[Engineering Love Struck]

132
00:07:30,540 --> 00:07:32,840
I put it there because I miss Anda.

133
00:07:34,659 --> 00:07:36,210
I haven't said anything yet.

134
00:07:37,050 --> 00:07:38,510
It's your business where you put it.

135
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:39,960
I just...
[Dorm Mate]

136
00:07:40,450 --> 00:07:43,930
noticed it was sitting there all by itself.

137
00:07:44,530 --> 00:07:46,140
While the others are all over here.

138
00:07:46,510 --> 00:07:47,330
Done?

139
00:07:49,520 --> 00:07:50,840
Stop being so full of yourself.

140
00:07:54,530 --> 00:07:55,470
Here, let me carry it.

141
00:07:55,500 --> 00:07:56,570
No, it's fine.

142
00:08:02,470 --> 00:08:04,400
That's the guy who was with Itti.

143
00:08:04,610 --> 00:08:05,400
Let go!

144
00:08:05,430 --> 00:08:06,130
Go!

145
00:08:06,150 --> 00:08:06,940
Shit!

146
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:10,590
What is he doing here?

147
00:08:16,210 --> 00:08:17,460
Hey.

148
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,520
- Hello.
- Hello.

149
00:08:20,740 --> 00:08:21,760
What are you doing here?

150
00:08:22,110 --> 00:08:22,890
Oh.

151
00:08:23,520 --> 00:08:27,200
I was told that
the suspect was in this room.

152
00:08:27,770 --> 00:08:28,680
Yes.

153
00:08:29,900 --> 00:08:31,200
I never imagined that

154
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:33,390
your room would be right next to hers.

155
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:36,049
No, sir. It's his room.

156
00:08:38,669 --> 00:08:40,000
In that case, let me ask you something.

157
00:08:40,500 --> 00:08:42,659
Have you ever talked to
the person in the next room?

158
00:08:43,340 --> 00:08:44,140
I have, sir.

159
00:08:46,760 --> 00:08:48,360
Do you guys have some free time?

160
00:08:48,390 --> 00:08:50,300
Do you have to be anywhere else?

161
00:08:55,850 --> 00:08:57,120
Do we have to record it?

162
00:08:57,590 --> 00:08:58,950
Just speak freely.

163
00:08:58,970 --> 00:09:00,000
Because now

164
00:09:00,220 --> 00:09:02,340
I'm officially on this case as well.

165
00:09:03,110 --> 00:09:06,190
I'll definitely catch the person
who did that to my brother.

166
00:09:07,940 --> 00:09:08,800
Yes, sir.

167
00:09:09,700 --> 00:09:12,650
The more information I get,
the easier everything will be.

168
00:09:13,540 --> 00:09:14,300
Alright?

169
00:09:16,550 --> 00:09:19,240
How long have you known Amp,

170
00:09:19,870 --> 00:09:20,940
your next-door neighbor?

171
00:09:21,770 --> 00:09:22,860
Not too long ago.

172
00:09:23,750 --> 00:09:25,090
Right before Anda passed away.

173
00:09:25,520 --> 00:09:27,720
And how has she been behaving?

174
00:09:28,770 --> 00:09:30,600
When I first met her,

175
00:09:31,650 --> 00:09:32,900
she seemed very friendly.

176
00:09:34,860 --> 00:09:35,970
She told me

177
00:09:36,090 --> 00:09:38,290
that she'd been Anda's fan
for a very long time.

178
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:41,210
She really seemed to like Anda.

179
00:09:43,660 --> 00:09:45,720
But the news says she's Anda's hater.

180
00:09:46,110 --> 00:09:50,180
And based on all the information,
there seems to be a personal grudge.

181
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:51,940
Yes.

182
00:09:52,330 --> 00:09:54,260
I don't understand that part either.

183
00:09:54,290 --> 00:09:56,900
Have you ever been to her room?

184
00:09:59,370 --> 00:10:00,420
No, never.

185
00:10:01,680 --> 00:10:05,760
We usually met in the elevator
or in front of the condo.

186
00:10:07,940 --> 00:10:08,570
But...

187
00:10:11,560 --> 00:10:13,620
the last few times I met Amp,

188
00:10:15,460 --> 00:10:16,780
something seemed off.

189
00:10:17,470 --> 00:10:19,070
She often had bruises on her body.

190
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:21,350
What now? What?

191
00:10:23,650 --> 00:10:25,180
It seemed like she knew James,

192
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,570
who was Anda's ship partner.

193
00:10:30,350 --> 00:10:31,480
James?

194
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,150
Interesting.

195
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:35,730
The day Amp was exposed

196
00:10:36,340 --> 00:10:39,350
was the same day
I took her to the hospital.

197
00:10:40,010 --> 00:10:41,690
The identity of Anda's hater.

198
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:44,330
However, we have to blur her face for now.

199
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:44,890
Right.

200
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:46,380
Can you walk?

201
00:10:46,410 --> 00:10:47,500
- That day...
- Yes.

202
00:10:47,690 --> 00:10:49,980
I saw blood running down her legs.

203
00:10:50,290 --> 00:10:51,340
What about my baby?

204
00:10:52,530 --> 00:10:54,810
The nurse said the baby is safe.

205
00:10:56,340 --> 00:10:58,080
It was only when she got to
the hospital that I found out

206
00:10:59,750 --> 00:11:00,870
she was pregnant.

207
00:11:03,400 --> 00:11:05,640
I also got this information
from the hospital.

208
00:11:06,450 --> 00:11:08,120
But what's weird is

209
00:11:09,050 --> 00:11:10,510
that she chose to run away.

210
00:11:11,940 --> 00:11:13,270
If you haven't done anything wrong,

211
00:11:13,940 --> 00:11:15,140
you don't need to run away.

212
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:20,350
So, what's your next move, sir?

213
00:11:21,950 --> 00:11:25,140
Right now, my team is checking
all the addresses.

214
00:11:25,610 --> 00:11:27,640
We'll probably investigate
through various channels.

215
00:11:27,930 --> 00:11:29,930
I won't let her go easily.

216
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:33,510
I'll drag whoever killed Anda to prison.

217
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:38,870
From now on, if you two have anything,

218
00:11:39,350 --> 00:11:40,800
feel free to call me anytime.

219
00:11:41,120 --> 00:11:42,390
Thank you both very much.

220
00:11:44,390 --> 00:11:45,270
Okay.

221
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:47,400
Let's go.

222
00:11:52,910 --> 00:11:54,870
And where are you two heading now?

223
00:11:57,100 --> 00:12:00,050
I'm taking him to stay with me.

224
00:12:00,670 --> 00:12:03,360
I don't want to leave him alone.
It's dangerous.

225
00:12:06,400 --> 00:12:08,300
I'll head out now.

226
00:12:08,770 --> 00:12:10,070
Sorry for taking up your time.

227
00:12:10,450 --> 00:12:13,300
Remember, call me anytime.

228
00:12:13,710 --> 00:12:15,620
- Yes, sir.
- Of course, sir.

229
00:12:15,830 --> 00:12:16,550
I'm off.

230
00:12:17,560 --> 00:12:18,750
- Goodbye.
- Goodbye.

231
00:12:36,700 --> 00:12:38,330
Your place is so tidy.

232
00:12:43,140 --> 00:12:44,360
Hey!

233
00:12:49,580 --> 00:12:50,540
What are you doing?

234
00:12:54,680 --> 00:12:57,030
What? I'm just going to shower.

235
00:12:59,180 --> 00:13:00,610
Please.

236
00:13:01,310 --> 00:13:04,250
Could you please warn me
before you do something like this?

237
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:05,800
What's with you?

238
00:13:06,140 --> 00:13:08,620
I'm tired from driving.
I just want to shower.

239
00:13:09,280 --> 00:13:10,930
You love playing with
my feelings, don't you?

240
00:13:12,820 --> 00:13:13,780
Fine.

241
00:13:14,230 --> 00:13:15,510
I'm going to take a shower now.

242
00:13:25,210 --> 00:13:27,020
I'm taking my pants off now.

243
00:13:29,740 --> 00:13:31,640
Dammit, Jin!

244
00:13:31,870 --> 00:13:32,910
What is wrong with you?

245
00:13:33,370 --> 00:13:36,410
You're the one who told me
to warn you before I do anything.

246
00:13:38,420 --> 00:13:39,250
Get lost!

247
00:13:39,470 --> 00:13:40,820
Just go do whatever you want.

248
00:13:41,460 --> 00:13:42,390
Go!

249
00:14:27,200 --> 00:14:28,320
Did you sleep well?

250
00:14:28,870 --> 00:14:29,750
Yeah.

251
00:14:31,020 --> 00:14:33,340
Go take a shower, quick.
Or we'll miss it.

252
00:14:36,530 --> 00:14:37,860
We're going to see a movie today.

253
00:14:38,860 --> 00:14:39,660
Which one?

254
00:14:40,510 --> 00:14:41,920
The one you wanted to see.

255
00:14:42,230 --> 00:14:42,990
Which one was it?

256
00:14:43,010 --> 00:14:44,990
What! You forgot already?

257
00:14:45,010 --> 00:14:46,020
Go shower.

258
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:48,350
Or do you want me to bathe you?

259
00:15:03,390 --> 00:15:04,330
Next time,

260
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:09,110
let me be the one
to choose the movie.

261
00:15:13,740 --> 00:15:14,820
Are you scared?

262
00:15:29,030 --> 00:15:30,460
Just eat it yourself.

263
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:37,320
You're having fun, huh?

264
00:15:38,780 --> 00:15:39,730
Of course I am.

265
00:15:40,510 --> 00:15:42,160
Every movie is fun
when I'm watching it with you.

266
00:15:46,450 --> 00:15:48,050
You can hold my hand. Want it?

267
00:16:03,650 --> 00:16:06,040
You're such a scaredy-cat.
There was nothing.

268
00:16:07,710 --> 00:16:08,560
Just eat this.

269
00:16:09,410 --> 00:16:10,720
You have some, too.

270
00:16:16,410 --> 00:16:17,960
That ghost at the end was so intense.

271
00:16:18,280 --> 00:16:20,010
I saw you keeping your eyes closed.

272
00:16:20,040 --> 00:16:21,290
You're exaggerating.

273
00:16:21,680 --> 00:16:22,860
I could handle it just fine.

274
00:16:23,970 --> 00:16:26,230
Okay, then for the next one,
you can pick whatever you want.

275
00:16:26,250 --> 00:16:26,830
Definitely.

276
00:16:26,850 --> 00:16:30,400
I thought engineering
and sports science students didn't get along.

277
00:16:31,270 --> 00:16:33,190
Risa, you're here for a movie, too?

278
00:16:33,220 --> 00:16:35,510
- Yeah.
- Hey, is it the same movie?

279
00:16:35,550 --> 00:16:38,200
Yeah. Don't spoil it!

280
00:16:38,940 --> 00:16:40,560
It's fun. Not that scary.

281
00:16:40,580 --> 00:16:41,660
Two out of ten.

282
00:16:42,310 --> 00:16:44,990
Ha! That means it's really scary.

283
00:16:46,900 --> 00:16:49,240
I'm so jealous.
You have someone to watch movies with.

284
00:16:51,150 --> 00:16:52,050
And...

285
00:16:52,690 --> 00:16:55,090
aren't those two your friends?

286
00:16:58,390 --> 00:17:00,000
I'm just teasing you guys.

287
00:17:00,530 --> 00:17:01,880
So...

288
00:17:02,700 --> 00:17:04,300
are you two...

289
00:17:04,599 --> 00:17:05,599
dating now?

290
00:17:06,430 --> 00:17:07,710
Mm-hmm, yes.

291
00:17:08,589 --> 00:17:09,319
Right?

292
00:17:11,730 --> 00:17:12,550
Yeah.

293
00:17:13,609 --> 00:17:16,150
But if others find out that students
from these two faculties are dating,

294
00:17:17,380 --> 00:17:19,280
it might be a bit strange.

295
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:21,880
It's fine.

296
00:17:22,060 --> 00:17:24,690
I don't intend to hide it anyway.

297
00:17:25,130 --> 00:17:26,589
I'd like others to know as well.

298
00:17:29,060 --> 00:17:30,340
I'll be right back.

299
00:17:30,620 --> 00:17:31,700
I'm going to the toilet for a second.

300
00:17:32,530 --> 00:17:33,520
You two go ahead and chat.

301
00:17:36,500 --> 00:17:37,720
Congratulations.

302
00:17:40,300 --> 00:17:42,360
Look, stop acting so clueless.

303
00:17:42,820 --> 00:17:45,860
Do you really not know that
Jin is really into you?

304
00:17:47,840 --> 00:17:48,660
But...

305
00:17:49,460 --> 00:17:51,700
I haven't even said yes to him yet.

306
00:17:52,650 --> 00:17:56,230
But Jin made up his mind long ago.

307
00:18:02,460 --> 00:18:05,050
Are you really serious about him?

308
00:18:06,980 --> 00:18:07,820
Yeah.

309
00:18:08,740 --> 00:18:10,580
I'm very serious about Podduang.

310
00:18:14,100 --> 00:18:17,040
At first, I didn't think
that he was this serious.

311
00:18:17,590 --> 00:18:21,260
I thought he was always that kind of guy.

312
00:18:21,790 --> 00:18:24,620
But I clearly remember
the look on his face

313
00:18:24,910 --> 00:18:27,240
when he said he was serious about you.

314
00:18:30,570 --> 00:18:33,770
Gosh, I can't enjoy the movie anymore.

315
00:18:36,150 --> 00:18:38,160
Are you going? The ads are almost over.

316
00:18:38,500 --> 00:18:39,300
Okay.

317
00:18:40,790 --> 00:18:42,650
Don't let me catch you at college,

318
00:18:42,670 --> 00:18:43,900
or I'll die of jealousy.

319
00:18:54,840 --> 00:18:55,800
Let's head back.

320
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:56,910
Yeah.

321
00:18:59,950 --> 00:19:01,370
- Just a second.
- Okay.

322
00:19:04,780 --> 00:19:07,030
[Don't get involved in Anda's case
if you still wanna live.]

323
00:19:10,010 --> 00:19:11,000
Are you okay?

324
00:19:16,420 --> 00:19:18,720
[Don't get involved in Anda's case
if you still wanna live.]

325
00:19:22,980 --> 00:19:24,290
How do they know you?

326
00:19:29,130 --> 00:19:30,950
We should report this to the police.

327
00:19:36,830 --> 00:19:39,210
[Royal Thai Police
Incident Report]

328
00:19:39,230 --> 00:19:41,620
Good thing I brought you here first.

329
00:19:41,880 --> 00:19:43,740
Otherwise, we'd be in real trouble.

330
00:19:44,280 --> 00:19:46,750
Even the police can't figure out
who the number belongs to.

331
00:19:48,640 --> 00:19:50,900
Do you think it's Amp?

332
00:19:53,370 --> 00:19:54,540
I'm not sure.

333
00:19:55,590 --> 00:19:56,770
It's possible, though.

334
00:19:59,300 --> 00:20:00,140
But...

335
00:20:01,550 --> 00:20:03,080
why would she do something like that?

336
00:20:05,380 --> 00:20:08,360
She knows we're investigating this, that's why.

337
00:20:18,370 --> 00:20:19,530
Can't sleep?

338
00:20:22,100 --> 00:20:23,160
Just have a lot on my mind.

339
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:27,770
Me too.

340
00:20:34,050 --> 00:20:35,240
I really want to see Amp.

341
00:20:39,070 --> 00:20:41,320
Aren't Bumm and Dunk
helping us find her?

342
00:20:44,290 --> 00:20:45,060
Yeah.

343
00:20:49,030 --> 00:20:50,350
You don't believe it, do you?

344
00:20:51,020 --> 00:20:52,390
That Amp was the one who did it?

345
00:20:55,680 --> 00:20:56,490
No.

346
00:21:03,470 --> 00:21:04,890
Don't you worry.

347
00:21:06,430 --> 00:21:08,390
We have to find whoever killed Anda.

348
00:21:09,110 --> 00:21:10,550
Everyone is helping us right now.

349
00:21:14,880 --> 00:21:15,820
Get some sleep now.

350
00:22:49,360 --> 00:22:50,530
Jin.

351
00:22:54,330 --> 00:22:55,750
It's cremation day.

352
00:22:58,480 --> 00:22:59,340
Anda.

353
00:23:00,030 --> 00:23:01,120
How are you doing?

354
00:23:03,420 --> 00:23:05,210
We're so close to figuring out the truth.

355
00:23:06,760 --> 00:23:08,610
2807.

356
00:23:09,770 --> 00:23:10,920
At home.

357
00:23:11,310 --> 00:23:12,340
The bedroom.

358
00:23:13,240 --> 00:23:14,230
I want it.

359
00:23:18,530 --> 00:23:19,780
2807.

360
00:23:29,660 --> 00:23:31,110
Are you going to sleep, Bumm?

361
00:23:32,480 --> 00:23:35,240
It looks like we're not students
anymore at this point.

362
00:23:37,170 --> 00:23:39,000
Are you going to graduate in
sports science to be a detective?

363
00:23:42,540 --> 00:23:44,180
There's nothing that can escape me.

364
00:23:45,120 --> 00:23:47,320
Don't say that.
It gives me the creeps.

365
00:24:16,320 --> 00:24:19,110
Cyber police are helping us
trace the location of the number.

366
00:24:19,690 --> 00:24:22,030
And I've already had local police
visit her home.

367
00:24:22,810 --> 00:24:25,350
But the suspect's parents
keep denying everything,

368
00:24:26,040 --> 00:24:28,300
saying their daughter
hasn't been home for years.

369
00:24:31,560 --> 00:24:32,590
Thank you, Lieutenant.

370
00:24:33,460 --> 00:24:35,520
That doesn't even include
what happened early this morning.

371
00:24:37,040 --> 00:24:37,820
What happened?

372
00:24:46,070 --> 00:24:47,990
Remember the account I showed you?

373
00:24:48,840 --> 00:24:50,660
It's active again.

374
00:24:52,130 --> 00:24:54,740
And this time,
jealousy is clearly the motive.

375
00:24:55,460 --> 00:24:57,560
Amp, James's girlfriend...

376
00:24:58,170 --> 00:25:00,110
James was your brother's ship partner.

377
00:25:01,190 --> 00:25:03,300
They've fought over this many times.

378
00:25:03,980 --> 00:25:04,840
James.

379
00:25:06,190 --> 00:25:07,080
That's interesting.

380
00:25:08,760 --> 00:25:11,240
And do you know where James is now?

381
00:25:11,620 --> 00:25:12,790
We still can't reach him.

382
00:25:24,720 --> 00:25:25,480
Yes?

383
00:25:25,800 --> 00:25:27,240
He called again, Boss.

384
00:25:29,350 --> 00:25:31,610
He said the money wasn't enough.

385
00:25:32,520 --> 00:25:33,720
What should we do?

386
00:25:38,940 --> 00:25:41,540
It's become a hot topic on social media again

387
00:25:41,560 --> 00:25:43,620
after it was revealed that the suspect, Amp,

388
00:25:43,870 --> 00:25:46,800
is the girlfriend of James,

389
00:25:46,820 --> 00:25:49,280
Anda's longtime ship partner.

390
00:25:49,600 --> 00:25:52,020
This incident is suspected
to have been caused by jealousy

391
00:25:52,270 --> 00:25:55,590
because Amp and James have been
dating for a long time.

392
00:25:55,750 --> 00:25:58,500
An account has posted crucial evidence,

393
00:25:58,800 --> 00:26:00,750
including photos and messages,

394
00:26:00,770 --> 00:26:04,660
that undeniably proves the two are
in a relationship.

395
00:26:21,320 --> 00:26:22,580
It's time...

396
00:26:23,580 --> 00:26:26,210
for me to let Anda go.

397
00:26:31,010 --> 00:26:33,920
I still dream about Anda
when he was a little boy.

398
00:26:37,470 --> 00:26:38,470
I...

399
00:26:39,930 --> 00:26:41,370
miss Anda so much, too.

400
00:26:48,890 --> 00:26:49,640
Jin.

401
00:26:53,820 --> 00:26:55,740
Is it true what they say?

402
00:26:56,670 --> 00:26:58,670
That there's someone who caused...

403
00:27:00,730 --> 00:27:02,160
Anda to...

404
00:27:02,190 --> 00:27:03,740
Oh! Jin.

405
00:27:05,250 --> 00:27:06,400
Hello, sir.

406
00:27:06,560 --> 00:27:07,290
Hello.

407
00:27:10,220 --> 00:27:12,140
I'm going to prepare for the cremation.

408
00:27:12,480 --> 00:27:13,460
Wanna come along?

409
00:27:17,910 --> 00:27:19,540
Dad, Mom.

410
00:27:23,080 --> 00:27:25,400
Anda really loved you both so much.

411
00:27:30,390 --> 00:27:34,370
I still feel like Anda is right here.

412
00:27:34,800 --> 00:27:36,660
Anda is still here.

413
00:27:37,090 --> 00:27:38,970
Anda hasn't gone anywhere.

414
00:27:49,350 --> 00:27:50,560
Dad, Mom.

415
00:27:53,800 --> 00:27:55,330
I have something to ask you.

416
00:28:00,340 --> 00:28:02,080
2807.

417
00:28:03,370 --> 00:28:04,390
At home.

418
00:28:04,830 --> 00:28:05,970
The bedroom.

419
00:28:06,760 --> 00:28:07,820
I want it.

420
00:28:10,830 --> 00:28:12,630
Do you happen to know

421
00:28:13,820 --> 00:28:15,790
what "2807,

422
00:28:16,870 --> 00:28:17,960
at home,

423
00:28:18,960 --> 00:28:19,780
bedroom"

424
00:28:19,850 --> 00:28:20,970
means?

425
00:28:26,950 --> 00:28:28,110
2807.

426
00:28:30,110 --> 00:28:33,040
Isn't that our birthdays, honey?

427
00:28:33,520 --> 00:28:34,750
2807.

428
00:28:36,230 --> 00:28:37,530
How do you know?

429
00:28:40,340 --> 00:28:41,830
Anda told me, Mom.

430
00:28:43,500 --> 00:28:44,000
Look...

431
00:28:45,060 --> 00:28:45,860
Jin.

432
00:28:47,700 --> 00:28:49,580
Don't talk such nonsense.

433
00:28:50,000 --> 00:28:51,280
Mom is already grieving enough.

434
00:28:52,080 --> 00:28:54,520
I understand that it sounds strange.

435
00:28:55,400 --> 00:28:59,500
But could you try to recall
this number and the bedroom?

436
00:29:06,780 --> 00:29:07,740
Or is it...

437
00:29:08,720 --> 00:29:10,780
that box that...

438
00:29:11,950 --> 00:29:13,310
- Be right back.
- Oh.

439
00:29:22,190 --> 00:29:24,200
When I was tidying up Anda's room,

440
00:29:24,590 --> 00:29:28,310
this box was the only one
that was locked.

441
00:29:28,760 --> 00:29:30,840
Could it be the code?

442
00:29:58,680 --> 00:30:01,600
[I want to be a prosecutor like my dad.]

443
00:30:15,170 --> 00:30:18,400
[If I don't want to be a prosecutor anymore,
will my dad be disappointed in me?]

444
00:30:29,920 --> 00:30:33,390
[If my mom knows that I like this friend,
will she be happy...?]

445
00:30:38,750 --> 00:30:40,140
Anda said...

446
00:30:43,080 --> 00:30:45,060
if the day came when he had to go,

447
00:30:46,460 --> 00:30:48,020
he wanted Dad and Mom...

448
00:30:49,050 --> 00:30:50,830
to bring the box to the cremation as well.

449
00:30:53,540 --> 00:30:54,430
Dad,

450
00:30:55,310 --> 00:30:57,450
Anda definitely didn't take his own life.

451
00:31:00,350 --> 00:31:02,350
I will find the person
who did this to Anda

452
00:31:03,870 --> 00:31:05,300
and make them pay.

453
00:31:08,470 --> 00:31:09,970
Please ask Anda...

454
00:31:14,530 --> 00:31:15,910
how he is doing.

455
00:31:30,080 --> 00:31:31,120
And...

456
00:31:32,130 --> 00:31:35,000
if you need anything,
you can tell me anytime.

457
00:31:35,340 --> 00:31:36,680
I'm willing to help.

458
00:31:37,510 --> 00:31:38,990
Yes, but... Dad and Mom,

459
00:31:40,240 --> 00:31:42,470
please don't tell anyone about this yet.

460
00:31:44,400 --> 00:31:46,210
It was Anda's wish.

461
00:31:49,130 --> 00:31:50,940
He wanted only the two of you to know.

462
00:32:08,320 --> 00:32:09,120
Oh.

463
00:32:10,180 --> 00:32:11,420
Hello, Itti.

464
00:32:12,410 --> 00:32:13,360
What are you doing here?

465
00:32:14,710 --> 00:32:16,970
I just came to visit Dad and Mom.

466
00:32:19,400 --> 00:32:20,300
And how is it going?

467
00:32:21,390 --> 00:32:22,800
Found anything more suspicious?

468
00:32:23,660 --> 00:32:25,060
We're investigating separately,

469
00:32:25,410 --> 00:32:27,320
looking at things one by one.

470
00:32:27,340 --> 00:32:29,400
Both the car and the CCTV.

471
00:32:29,560 --> 00:32:31,450
Everything looks suspicious.

472
00:32:32,920 --> 00:32:34,290
I think so, too.

473
00:32:34,310 --> 00:32:36,910
Podduang just got a threatening text.

474
00:32:37,870 --> 00:32:38,790
A text?

475
00:32:39,330 --> 00:32:41,170
Yes, telling him to stop
getting involved in this.

476
00:32:42,350 --> 00:32:43,760
I think that's dangerous.

477
00:32:44,460 --> 00:32:45,840
Have you reported it
to the police yet?

478
00:32:46,780 --> 00:32:47,580
Yes.

479
00:32:50,500 --> 00:32:51,540
I think from now on,

480
00:32:52,160 --> 00:32:53,880
you and your friends should be careful.

481
00:32:54,770 --> 00:32:56,990
Don't put yourself in unnecessary danger.

482
00:32:57,580 --> 00:32:58,980
Let the police handle it.

483
00:33:01,860 --> 00:33:03,070
Yes.

484
00:33:03,570 --> 00:33:05,210
Then I'll take my leave.

485
00:33:05,590 --> 00:33:06,680
Goodbye.

486
00:33:35,320 --> 00:33:36,450
My brother's got it bad.

487
00:33:37,140 --> 00:33:38,520
Huh? What was that?

488
00:33:39,430 --> 00:33:40,850
Nothing. It's nothing.

489
00:33:41,790 --> 00:33:43,820
You know, you don't really have
to stay here with me.

490
00:33:44,370 --> 00:33:45,520
I can look after myself.

491
00:33:46,040 --> 00:33:47,290
Stop acting so tough.

492
00:33:47,640 --> 00:33:48,730
Just eat your food.

493
00:33:51,240 --> 00:33:53,170
You've been checking your phone all day.

494
00:33:53,630 --> 00:33:54,590
So, are you two official yet?

495
00:33:59,870 --> 00:34:00,790
I knew it.

496
00:34:02,150 --> 00:34:03,080
That silence says it all.

497
00:34:04,520 --> 00:34:05,370
You guys have done it, haven't you?

498
00:34:05,400 --> 00:34:06,970
Satang! You little brat!

499
00:34:07,200 --> 00:34:08,969
Come on, Podduang. We're adults now.

500
00:34:09,280 --> 00:34:10,790
It's 2026 already.

501
00:34:11,480 --> 00:34:13,449
Siblings don't keep secrets anymore.

502
00:34:14,280 --> 00:34:16,170
What do you mean, "It's 2026"?

503
00:34:16,940 --> 00:34:19,020
You're such a smartass.
Don't forget I'm your older brother.

504
00:34:19,040 --> 00:34:20,739
Oh, by the way,
do you know what your name is?

505
00:34:21,219 --> 00:34:21,880
What name?

506
00:34:22,650 --> 00:34:23,409
Podduang...

507
00:34:23,730 --> 00:34:24,659
Yeah, so?

508
00:34:25,280 --> 00:34:26,219
Ronnarak.

509
00:34:54,530 --> 00:34:55,780
I already told you

510
00:34:56,300 --> 00:34:57,960
to leave me and Auntie Amphon alone.

511
00:34:58,640 --> 00:35:01,580
Master really wants to talk to you, Mr. Jin.

512
00:35:02,110 --> 00:35:03,340
Someone who truly wants to talk

513
00:35:03,370 --> 00:35:04,680
wouldn't send a lawyer.

514
00:35:25,760 --> 00:35:27,930
I want you to come back to our home.

515
00:35:33,340 --> 00:35:35,530
You can bring your aunt with you, too.

516
00:35:37,030 --> 00:35:38,580
Why do you want me to come back?

517
00:35:40,070 --> 00:35:42,160
To be a puppet for your business again?

518
00:35:44,660 --> 00:35:45,420
Yes.

519
00:35:46,900 --> 00:35:48,450
If that's what you think,

520
00:35:49,230 --> 00:35:50,630
then my answer is yes.

521
00:35:57,520 --> 00:35:58,730
How have you been?

522
00:36:00,050 --> 00:36:01,920
You've been having the lawyer
check on me all this time.

523
00:36:03,010 --> 00:36:04,130
So you should already know.

524
00:36:10,670 --> 00:36:11,470
Jin...

525
00:36:14,360 --> 00:36:15,310
I'm sorry.

526
00:36:15,740 --> 00:36:16,780
There's no need for you to apologize.

527
00:36:18,210 --> 00:36:19,880
You never loved me or Mom anyway.

528
00:36:22,100 --> 00:36:23,490
You only care about your assets.

529
00:36:30,650 --> 00:36:31,520
Yes.

530
00:36:33,000 --> 00:36:34,180
In the past,

531
00:36:35,160 --> 00:36:37,030
I really did love my assets.

532
00:36:39,280 --> 00:36:40,200
That's why...

533
00:36:41,630 --> 00:36:43,840
I want to leave all of it to you.

534
00:36:54,890 --> 00:36:55,690
Hello.

535
00:36:56,320 --> 00:36:57,590
What are you doing?

536
00:36:58,100 --> 00:37:00,110
Just scrolling through the news.

537
00:37:00,810 --> 00:37:02,180
Looking for any updates on Amp.

538
00:37:03,020 --> 00:37:04,410
But Bumm's been keeping
a close eye on it, too.

539
00:37:05,260 --> 00:37:06,430
So, who are you with?

540
00:37:06,590 --> 00:37:07,500
Where's Satang?

541
00:37:07,530 --> 00:37:08,850
Satang's busy playing games.

542
00:37:09,980 --> 00:37:10,860
And you?

543
00:37:11,480 --> 00:37:12,410
What are you up to?

544
00:37:14,160 --> 00:37:15,770
I'm busy thinking of you.

545
00:37:19,010 --> 00:37:20,590
The bed is so big.

546
00:37:20,920 --> 00:37:23,440
I don't know how
I can sleep here all by myself.

547
00:37:24,560 --> 00:37:25,640
Look who's talking.

548
00:37:25,910 --> 00:37:27,720
You've been sleeping alone for years.

549
00:37:28,720 --> 00:37:29,610
Wait...

550
00:37:30,030 --> 00:37:31,080
Or was I wrong?

551
00:37:32,410 --> 00:37:33,210
What?

552
00:37:33,690 --> 00:37:35,370
I really do sleep alone.

553
00:37:38,860 --> 00:37:39,800
Who is it?

554
00:37:41,720 --> 00:37:42,590
I don't know.

555
00:37:45,130 --> 00:37:45,960
Satang.

556
00:37:47,230 --> 00:37:48,030
Satang!

557
00:37:53,430 --> 00:37:55,290
Hey, are you really opening the door?

558
00:38:09,360 --> 00:38:10,550
Fried chicken delivery!

559
00:38:13,410 --> 00:38:14,860
Satang!

560
00:38:17,470 --> 00:38:19,690
Oh, sorry. I forgot about the chicken.

561
00:38:20,500 --> 00:38:22,460
- Can I scan to pay?
- Yes.

562
00:38:24,550 --> 00:38:25,740
I'm getting so paranoid.

563
00:38:26,700 --> 00:38:27,930
That's all. I'm going to eat now.

564
00:38:33,500 --> 00:38:34,820
Are you done talking to Jin yet?

565
00:38:35,560 --> 00:38:36,760
Can't you see for yourself?

566
00:38:45,680 --> 00:38:52,880
[Mr. Chanin]

567
00:39:13,320 --> 00:39:15,810
I'll return and take over your business.

568
00:39:16,360 --> 00:39:18,190
But I have two conditions.

569
00:39:19,330 --> 00:39:22,540
You have to let me see
every CCTV in your condo.

570
00:39:25,320 --> 00:39:26,200
Have a seat.

571
00:39:26,220 --> 00:39:27,630
That's my offer.

572
00:39:30,310 --> 00:39:32,380
Sit down first,
then I'll grant your request.

573
00:39:43,950 --> 00:39:47,220
I have no problem with your conditions.

574
00:39:48,570 --> 00:39:50,670
Honestly, I haven't been neglecting it.

575
00:39:51,340 --> 00:39:53,670
You can see for yourself

576
00:39:53,690 --> 00:39:56,420
whether the camera I mentioned is really broken.

577
00:39:58,010 --> 00:39:59,550
I've been trying to help you, too.

578
00:40:00,840 --> 00:40:03,410
Fine. I'll definitely check them all.

579
00:40:05,760 --> 00:40:06,650
Lawyer,

580
00:40:07,880 --> 00:40:09,860
have a technician ready to assist Jin.

581
00:40:10,120 --> 00:40:10,860
Yes, sir.

582
00:40:12,720 --> 00:40:13,900
One more thing...

583
00:40:14,550 --> 00:40:16,440
I want you to look after my people.

584
00:40:19,350 --> 00:40:20,360
Your people?

585
00:40:22,120 --> 00:40:22,770
Yes.

586
00:40:35,730 --> 00:40:37,220
Then come back to stay at our home.

587
00:40:37,670 --> 00:40:40,150
I only promised
to take over the business.

588
00:40:40,660 --> 00:40:42,500
I'll decide about moving back later.

589
00:40:54,120 --> 00:40:55,640
This is absolutely grand.

590
00:40:56,250 --> 00:40:59,030
No one's going to mind us being here?

591
00:40:59,730 --> 00:41:01,450
I asked my father to help.

592
00:41:02,200 --> 00:41:05,260
If I didn't know you,

593
00:41:05,280 --> 00:41:08,530
I'd definitely think
you were the owner's son.

594
00:41:08,830 --> 00:41:11,140
Then who is your father?

595
00:41:14,340 --> 00:41:15,100
So?

596
00:41:15,490 --> 00:41:16,290
What?

597
00:41:16,630 --> 00:41:17,780
What's with the nodding?

598
00:41:18,550 --> 00:41:20,920
I asked the condo owner for help.

599
00:41:21,340 --> 00:41:22,900
Oh.

600
00:41:22,930 --> 00:41:24,120
Shit!

601
00:41:24,250 --> 00:41:25,200
So it turns out

602
00:41:25,490 --> 00:41:27,990
you're the chairman's son.

603
00:41:31,720 --> 00:41:34,210
Why didn't I ever know that?

604
00:41:35,850 --> 00:41:37,130
I never told anyone.

605
00:41:38,120 --> 00:41:39,530
Only Auntie Amphon knows.

606
00:41:40,210 --> 00:41:41,140
Besides...

607
00:41:42,370 --> 00:41:43,950
I don't really want to be
his son that much anyway.

608
00:41:45,570 --> 00:41:47,590
Oh, so how's it going?

609
00:41:47,610 --> 00:41:49,390
Did you find anything off?

610
00:41:50,190 --> 00:41:52,630
I hope the camera captured
everything clearly.

611
00:41:53,230 --> 00:41:54,730
So this can finally be over.

612
00:41:55,110 --> 00:41:56,050
I haven't found anything yet.

613
00:41:59,280 --> 00:42:01,050
Can you zoom in on this
camera for me a bit?

614
00:42:01,070 --> 00:42:01,870
Yes, I can.

615
00:42:19,520 --> 00:42:21,020
The dealer made the first move.

616
00:42:33,840 --> 00:42:35,380
I promise, sir.

617
00:42:35,410 --> 00:42:37,130
I'll get the money
and pay you back as soon as possible.

618
00:42:37,770 --> 00:42:39,110
I'm really struggling lately.

619
00:42:40,230 --> 00:42:43,050
I can't reach my wife.
I don't know where she went.

620
00:42:43,720 --> 00:42:45,260
Can I have two days?

621
00:42:45,820 --> 00:42:46,840
I promise.

622
00:42:47,620 --> 00:42:49,310
I'll pay you back as soon as possible.

623
00:42:51,610 --> 00:42:53,250
You're quite impressive.

624
00:42:53,940 --> 00:42:56,270
Finding two million in just two days?

625
00:43:15,940 --> 00:43:16,970
I'm sorry.

626
00:43:18,020 --> 00:43:19,490
I really do promise.

627
00:43:20,220 --> 00:43:21,670
I'll definitely get the money.

628
00:43:35,500 --> 00:43:36,200
Yes.

629
00:43:36,910 --> 00:43:37,920
Hey, you.

630
00:43:38,660 --> 00:43:41,480
I don't think the money
you gave me is enough.

631
00:43:42,260 --> 00:43:43,780
I want to ask for another...

632
00:43:44,450 --> 00:43:45,460
million, okay?

633
00:43:46,240 --> 00:43:49,620
I know your boss wouldn't even feel it.

634
00:43:53,620 --> 00:43:54,610
Boss.

635
00:43:55,600 --> 00:43:56,970
He's asking for another million.

636
00:43:59,840 --> 00:44:01,920
I've found someone
with even worse luck than you.

637
00:44:05,860 --> 00:44:07,080
Go drag him over.

638
00:44:08,250 --> 00:44:09,890
And take this bastard

639
00:44:10,070 --> 00:44:11,660
to see for himself

640
00:44:12,600 --> 00:44:14,700
what happens when you mess with me.

641
00:44:34,600 --> 00:44:36,140
Ever since what happened to Anda,

642
00:44:36,390 --> 00:44:38,090
your life has been in constant danger.

643
00:44:38,110 --> 00:44:39,780
I don't want anything to happen to you.

644
00:44:40,100 --> 00:44:41,330
You're too nice.

645
00:44:41,350 --> 00:44:42,820
If you make Podduang sad,

646
00:44:42,850 --> 00:44:44,320
I won't go easy on you.

647
00:44:44,350 --> 00:44:46,220
We've come this far.

648
00:44:46,260 --> 00:44:47,380
Let's end this matter.

649
00:44:47,560 --> 00:44:49,530
I found the garage
where Anda got his car fixed.

650
00:44:49,560 --> 00:44:51,410
I found something in the footage.

651
00:44:51,430 --> 00:44:53,250
That's one of Itti's men.

652
00:44:53,350 --> 00:44:55,490
Do you want your debt to be wiped out?

653
00:44:55,520 --> 00:44:56,700
What do you want me to do?

654
00:44:56,720 --> 00:44:57,850
Can I come in?

655
00:44:59,400 --> 00:45:00,760
Podduang isn't answering my calls.

656
00:45:00,780 --> 00:45:01,570
Jin.

657
00:45:02,480 --> 00:45:03,600
Go help Podduang!

